 ("The capstone builds a tiny AlphaGo on a small board. The same parts, a gut feeling, a judge and a careful search, at toy size so you can see every step.",
  "which parts of AlphaGo does the miniature version keep?"),
 ("AlphaGo beat a world champion in 2016, and later versions learned without human games. Critics ask about cost, narrow skill and what it teaches about general intelligence.",
  "what changed between AlphaGo and its successors?"),
